{"t": 1795072725.698638, "kind": "assistant", "text": "The upgrade to PHP 8.3 has caused fatal errors on the public-facing pages due to the **limit-login-attempts-reloaded** plugin. This plugin is not compatible with PHP 8.3.\n\n### Production Change Plan\n\n**Proposed Change:**\n- Upgrade PHP to **8.3** on production.\n- **Before going live**, the **limit-login-attempts-reloaded** plugin must be updated to a version that supports PHP 8.3 or replaced with an alternative. Do **not** proceed to production until this is resolved.\n\nPlease update or replace the incompatible plugin, then apply the PHP upgrade on production. Let me know when you’re ready to proceed."}
